    "pros": [
      "Same TEMPUR material used in Tempur-Pedic mattresses",
      "Deep, slow contouring suits side sleepers on firm beds",
      "Cool-to-touch cover is removable and washable",
      "10-year limited warranty, the longest here alongside Sleep Innovations",
