    "bottomLine": "The cozy choice for side sleepers who want a plush pillow top on a hard bed.",
    "description": "The Sleep Innovations Dual Layer is two toppers in one. The most common version pairs 2 inches of gel memory foam with a 2-inch quilted fiberfill pillow top, for 4 inches in total. The pillow top slips over the foam and wraps around the edges of the mattress, which holds both layers together and keeps them from shifting. You can use either layer on its own, which is useful if the full 4 inches turns out to be too much. The result is the softest, most hotel-like feel in this guide. Reviewers describe it as plush and softer than most mattresses, and they note that heavier sleepers sink in further. That makes it a good match for side sleepers on a firm bed and a poor one for stomach sleepers or anyone whose lower back hurts after a night on a soft surface. The fiber top lets air move more freely than a solid foam slab, which helps with heat. Be aware that some listings describe a different split, 3 inches of foam under a 1-inch pillow top, so read the specs for the size you buy. Retail listings describe a 10-year warranty. Check today's price, which varies widely by size and seller."
