    "bottomLine": "A cheap, honest way to take the edge off a hard mattress, if you add your own cover.",
    "description": "The Linenspa is the topper to buy when you want to soften a firm mattress for the least money. It is a single slab of polyurethane memory foam with small gel beads mixed through it, sold in 2 and 3 inch heights, and the foam is CertiPUR-US certified. Sleep Foundation rates both heights as medium, about 5 on a 10-point scale, with the 3-inch version conforming more deeply. Linenspa says the gel helps it sleep cooler than plain memory foam, though at heart it is still memory foam. What you give up for the price is clear. There is no cover, the foam is spot clean only, and there are no straps, so it relies on friction and a fitted sheet to stay put. One reviewer found it stayed in place on their bed without anchors, but owners of strapless toppers commonly report some shifting. The 3-inch version needs deep-pocket sheets. Linenspa does not publish a density figure, so expect it to soften sooner than a denser foam like the ViscoSoft. It carries a 3-year limited warranty. Add a zippered topper cover, and it is a sensible low-cost fix. Check today's price."
  },
  {
    "id": "lucid-3in-ventilated-gel-topper",
    "name": "LUCID 3 Inch Ventilated Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper",
    "category": "Ventilated gel memory foam, 2 to 4 in, plush",
    "badge": "Best Ventilated Foam",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "specs": [
