    "bottomLine": "A low-cost vented gel topper that lets you pick the exact thickness you need.",
    "description": "The Lucid Ventilated Gel is a memory foam topper with cooling gel and holes punched through the foam to let heat out. Lucid sells it in 2, 3 and 4 inch heights, the widest range in this guide, which is useful because thickness matters more than almost anything else in how a topper feels. Reviewers describe the feel as plush, so it suits side sleepers softening a firm mattress better than back sleepers. Lucid deserves credit for candor. Its own site rates the gel topper 3 out of 5 for cooling and 3 out of 5 for pressure relief, which is a realistic picture: the vents help, but this is still memory foam. There is no cover and there are no straps, so pair it with a zippered cover or a deep-pocket fitted sheet. Bought direct, Lucid offers a 30-day trial, and the topper carries a 3-year limited warranty against defects in materials or workmanship; it excludes normal wear, stains and misuse. Lucid does not publish a foam density. Buy the 2-inch version for a light change, or the 3-inch version if you sleep on your side. Check today's price, as Lucid runs frequent sales."
  },
  {
    "id": "zinus-green-tea-3in-topper",
    "name": "ZINUS 3 Inch Green Tea Memory Foam Mattress Topper",
