          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A mattress topper is worth buying when your mattress is supportive but feels wrong on top. For most beds, the ViscoSoft 3 Inch Select High Density is the one we would choose first, with the Tempur-Adapt + Cooling for side sleepers who want the deepest cushion and the Pure Green firm latex for sore backs.
          </p>
